<title>USA: West Marine same-store sales rise 7 pct.</title>
<headline>West Marine same-store sales rise 7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>				1996	 1995	  Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		    $19.5	   $12.65	 4.6   7.1</p>
<p>Year-to-date	  $293.4	  $204.24	 3.7   5.7</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage. The company said sales for November were positively affected by the delay in the Thanksgiving holiday, which was in the last week of November in 1995 and the first week of December in 1996.</p>
<p>    Month is Nov weeks ended Nov. 23</p>
<p>    Full company name is  West Marine Inc</p>
</text>
